OpenJudge-AgentLab uses OpenJudge through its public grading interfaces.
Repository: https://github.com/agentscope-ai/OpenJudge
Pinned source commit: c2fdc38314cd971b03d4d9333cd2c9f24d85c27f
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0.
The setup script fetches an unmodified upstream checkout into ignored upstream/;
it is not vendored as part of this repository. See UPSTREAM.json.

The agentlab/ package, synthetic ticket fixtures, execution gateway,
experiment orchestration, tests, scripts and project documentation are
project-specific extensions. They are not official OpenJudge features
and are not presented as an upstream contribution. The root LICENSE
applies to these extensions as well.

Task lifecycle and isolation designs reference deepseek-ai/dsh-superagent-prototype.
No DSH runtime or source code is included or reproduced.
